%% Loan Disbursement Activity
flowchart TD
Start([Start]) --> N0[Select approved loan]
N0 --> N1[Validate role and APPROVED state]
N1 --> N2[Enter actual disbursement amount/date]
N2 --> N3[Persist disbursement and transition to ACTIVE]
N3 --> N4[Record LOAN_DISBURSED event]
N4 --> N5[Show result and blockchain status]
N5 --> End([End])
V -- No --> Err[Reject invalid transition; no unauthorized mutation]
V -- Yes --> N1
